Scope and recipe content

The MIT grant above covers Weektable's original application code, illustrations,
documentation, and 12 original starter recipes. Those 12 recipe records also
retain the CC0 notices in their source metadata.

The 28 credited source adaptations in data/recipes.json and
recipe-packs/reader-favourites.json are excluded from this MIT grant and from
the original recipes' CC0 notices. This exclusion also applies to the same
records in the separately supplied weektable-recipe-pack.json.

The sourced records use factual ingredient quantities and newly written cooking
summaries, with original-source attribution and links to publisher policies.
They are supplied for personal, noncommercial recipe planning, not as an
open-licensed collection. Rights in the source recipes and publisher materials
remain with their respective rights holders. No source photography or blog
narrative is included. Review source policies before redistributing the recipe
collection or using it commercially; inclusion in this repository does not
itself grant additional source-content rights.

See docs/RECIPE_COLLECTION.md and docs/RECIPE_SOURCES.json, together with each
recipe's source.licenseUrl, for provenance, adaptations, and relevant policies.
This license also grants no rights to third-party photographs, trademarks, or
material imported separately by a user. Attribution and source ratings do not
imply endorsement of Weektable by the source publishers.
